00:01:09.569 --> 00:01:11.938
EXTENSION OF NEWSPAPER'S FULFILL

00:01:12.005 --> 00:01:13.573
A CRITICAL ROLE IN OUR DEMOCRACY

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:16.042
AND WE CANNOT SURVIVE WITHOUT A

00:01:16.109 --> 00:01:18.211
ROBUST FOURTH ESTATE. THIS ROLE

00:01:18.278 --> 00:01:19.179
IS AMPLIFIED GIVEN THE

00:01:19.245 --> 00:01:20.980
