00:01:21.548 --> 00:01:24.150
PLAGUING MEDIA. THE COMMUNITIES

00:01:24.217 --> 00:01:26.786
THAT RELY ON PRINT PUBLICATIONS

00:01:26.853 --> 00:01:27.987
CANNOT AFFORD TO BE OVERLOOKED.

00:01:28.054 --> 00:01:29.422
AT A TIME WHEN OUR DEMOCRACY

00:01:29.489 --> 00:01:30.557
LIES IN THE BALANCE. THIS IS

00:01:30.623 --> 00:01:33.460
ESPECIALLY RELEVANT TO ME AS MY

00:01:33.526 --> 00:01:36.095
85 YEAR, 84 YEAR OLD FATHER GETS

00:01:36.162 --> 00:01:37.630
HIS PRINT SUBSCRIPTION OF LA

00:01:37.697 --> 00:01:40.733
OPINION EVERY SINGLE DAY. HIS

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:41.868
PERSONAL ACCESS TO NEWS MEDIA IS

00:01:41.935 --> 00:01:43.369
NOT UNIQUE, AS COUNTLESS

00:01:43.436 --> 00:01:46.473
COMMUNITY PUBLICATIONS OFTEN

00:01:46.539 --> 00:01:47.006
SERVING EXCLUSIVELY ETHNIC

00:01:47.073 --> 00:01:48.107
COMMUNITIES, WOULD NOT SURVIVE

00:01:48.174 --> 00:01:49.442
WITHOUT THIS EXTENSION. THE

00:01:49.509 --> 00:01:51.177
NEWSPAPER PROFESSION CONTINUES

00:01:51.244 --> 00:01:54.113
TO FACE FINANCIAL CHALLENGES

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:55.014
RESULTING FROM LOSS OF AD

00:01:55.081 --> 00:01:58.251
REVENUE TO TECH GIANTS WHILE

00:01:58.318 --> 00:01:59.752
TRANSITIONING TO DIGITAL

00:01:59.819 --> 00:02:00.820
PLATFORMS, AND A DECLINE IN

00:02:00.887 --> 00:02:02.889
SUBSCRIPTIONS. THESE REASONS

00:02:02.956 --> 00:02:03.890
COMPOUND WITH COMPOUNDED WITH

00:02:03.957 --> 00:02:06.292
THE UNIQUE STRUCTURE IN WHICH

00:02:06.359 --> 00:02:08.561
CARRIERS CONTRACT WITH MULTIPLE

00:02:08.628 --> 00:02:09.562
PUBLISHERS, PLACES STRESSES ON

00:02:09.629 --> 00:02:11.865
THE INDUSTRY, WHICH IS NOT SEEN

00:02:11.931 --> 00:02:15.034
ELSEWHERE, AND THAT IS WHY WE

00:02:15.101 --> 00:02:16.269
ARE HERE TODAY. DESPITE THIS,

00:02:16.336 --> 00:02:17.871
THE INDUSTRY IS MAKING

00:02:17.937 --> 00:02:18.738
SIGNIFICANT STRIDES IN

00:02:18.805 --> 00:02:20.573
TRANSITIONING COMPLETELY TO

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:21.574
DIGITAL NEWSPAPERS, CONTINUE TO

00:02:21.641 --> 00:02:23.676
PROVIDE CRITICAL INFORMATION ON

00:02:23.743 --> 00:02:26.946
ISSUES RANGING FROM LOCAL TO

00:02:27.013 --> 00:02:27.947
INTERNATIONAL, AND OFTEN THEY

00:02:28.014 --> 00:02:29.015
ARE THE SOLE SOURCE OF

00:02:29.082 --> 00:02:30.049
INFORMATION FOR MANY OF OUR

00:02:30.116 --> 00:02:31.851
COMMUNITIES, WHICH IS THE CASE

00:02:31.918 --> 00:02:33.052
FOR MY FATHER. BY PROVIDING

00:02:33.119 --> 00:02:33.920
ADDITIONAL TIME FOR THIS

00:02:33.987 --> 00:02:36.322
TRANSITION, JOBS FOR

00:02:36.389 --> 00:02:37.156
JOURNALISTS, JOURNALISTS,

00:02:37.223 --> 00:02:38.925
EDITORS AND NEWS NEWS PRODUCTION

00:02:38.992 --> 00:02:41.461
WORKERS WILL BE PROTECTED WHILE

00:02:41.528 --> 00:02:44.597
SIMULTANEOUSLY SUPPORTING THE

00:02:44.664 --> 00:02:45.798
