00:04:51.557 --> 00:04:53.660
ORGANIZATIONS ARE IN A CRITICAL

00:04:53.726 --> 00:04:54.794
PERIOD OF TRANSITION. PRINTING

00:04:54.861 --> 00:04:55.795
NEWSPAPERS HAS BECOME COST

00:04:55.862 --> 00:04:57.597
