00:05:18.284 --> 00:05:20.019
IN A WAY THAT IS SUSTAINABLE. AT

00:05:20.086 --> 00:05:21.154
A MOMENT WHEN NEWSPAPERS ARE

00:05:21.220 --> 00:05:22.188
SHUTTING DOWN EVERY WEEK, THIS

00:05:22.255 --> 00:05:24.257
LEGISLATION WILL PROVIDE THE

00:05:24.323 --> 00:05:26.125
RUNWAY TO STAND UP A NEW LONG

00:05:26.192 --> 00:05:26.993
TERM BUSINESS MODEL. THIS

00:05:27.060 --> 00:05:28.594
EXTENSION WILL ENSURE THAT LOCAL

00:05:28.661 --> 00:05:30.296
